@title Drive hoist property section: floor under the hook, rope stiffness and rope damping rows on the motor (1920x1080)
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# Where to find it: select the hoist motor in the drawing, the property sheet shows the section
# "Drive hoist" with the rope rows (floor under the hook, rope stiffness, rope damping) under the hook load.
open qa/fixtures/hoist-drive-floor.novo
wait 30
key Escape
wait 5
key Home
wait 30
shot overview
click 644 311
wait 30
shot motor-selected
expect "Drive hoist"
scroll 1700 500 -600
wait 20
shot drive-hoist-rows
scroll 1700 500 -900
wait 20
scroll 1700 500 300
wait 20
expect "Floor under the hook"
shot rope-rows
check_layout
